Must Learn (High Priority)

1. os, sys, subprocess   → System automation          -- Modules (built into Python)
2. requests              → API interactions
3. boto3                 → Cloud (AWS)
4. pyyaml                → Config files
5. paramiko              → SSH automation
6. docker                → Container management
7. pytest                → Testing your scripts

Good to Know (Medium Priority)

8. kubernetes       → manage K8s resources
9. logging         → proper log management         -- Modules (built into Python)
10. argparse        → command line tools           -- Modules (built into Python)
11. re              → regex for log parsing        -- Modules (built into Python)

Bonus (Nice to Have)   -- Ignore now

12. schedule        → run scripts on schedule
13. smtplib         → send email alerts
14. slack_sdk       → send Slack alerts
15. prometheus_client→ expose metrics
16. fabric          → remote server automation

These are enough to:

• Automate deployments
• Build CI/CD utilities
• Manage AWS resources
• Work with Docker/Kubernetes
• Parse logs/configs
• Create internal DevOps tools
• Build monitoring/maintenance scripts

But for a complete DevOps profile, also learn these outside Python:
