Python
- AWS automation
- Complex deployments
- Monitoring tools
- API automation
- Kubernetes automation
- Custom DevOps platforms
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Industry preference

| Scenario                 | Preferred |
| ------------------------ | --------- |
| Simple server automation | Bash      |
| CI/CD scripts            | Bash      |
| Cloud automation         | Python    |
| Kubernetes automation    | Python    |
| Large scalable tools     | Python    |
| One-liner commands       | Bash      |

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
For Kubernetes + DevOps career:

- Learn Bash first
- Then Python automation
- Then Kubernetes SDKs & boto3

That combination is highly valuable in DevOps/SRE roles.
